    "To activate Firebase (push + App Check):",
    "  1. Firebase Console -> Add project (unique per app).",
    "  2. Register an Android app with applicationId com.embervault.blazebound.",
    "  3. Download google-services.json, save it NEXT TO this file at",
    "     android/app/google-services.json (gitignored).",
    "Until the real file is present the Google Services Gradle plugin is",
